the Member State complies with the Treaty establishing the European Atomic Energy Community (‘Euratom Treaty’) and with legislation adopted on its basis, in particular, Directive 2009/71/Euratom, Directive 2011/70/Euratom and Council Directive 2013/59/Euratom (
                        24
