until 31 December 2025, vehicles designated as categories M2 and M3 (
                        83
                     ) that have a type of bodywork classified as ‘CA’ (single-deck vehicle), ‘CB’ (double-deck vehicle), ‘CC’ (single-deck articulated vehicle) or ‘CD’ (double-deck articulated vehicle) (
                        84
